<item>
<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli air strikes in Gaza have killed senior Hamas security officials, while doctors warn of a meningitis outbreak and Oxfam describes Gaza as a toxic wasteland due to environmental damage. The Israeli Defense Ministry reports over 31,500 troops have sought rehabilitation services since Oct. 7, and the IDF is probing 16 cases of soldiers using human shields in Gaza and the West Bank. Israeli forces continue to target Hamas infrastructure, and the conflict has caused 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/24/malaysia-set-to-return-thousands-of-rohingya-refugees-to-myanmar-2?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/24/israeli-air-strikes-in-gaza-kill-7-as-doctors-warn-of-meningitis-outbreak?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168862&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261124-israeli-strikes-on-gaza-kill-senior-hamas-security-official-and-six-other-people-medics-say&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOU2kzMmI1TnJBa2ZGWHlUNTd2WDR2RjZFaDVBclIyR2JQcXBkemthYXMwdjR4eHBYOHE5UTB2UXVIUmNlbGtDQXNQbl9rSDhNYk53dHhZYzdUSTdEZ0JjcTVrR3NmTUMxOVRucDViZ2FRZ3ppU1U1bzhmTHFJcERrdkd1NGdFT3Z1V0JDbVItTmxhVVA2azQxaF94Q3U2STZS?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: